{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06753","headline":"别刘諝 · 王昌龄","name":"别刘諝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天地寒更雨，苍茫楚城阴。\n一尊广陵酒，十载衡阳心。\n倚仗不可料，悲欢岂易寻。\n相逢成远别，後会何如今。\n身在江海上，云连京国深。\n行当务功业，策马何駸駸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06753.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06753","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}